MARA application distribution

This project is a modified and branded fork of Cinnamon/kotaemon:
https://github.com/Cinnamon/kotaemon

The upstream project is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
This fork retains the Apache License 2.0 terms and preserves upstream
attribution while applying local modifications under the MARA product name.

This distribution bundles the official Mozilla PDF.js v6.1.200 compressed
distribution from https://github.com/mozilla/pdf.js. PDF.js is licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0; its license is included in the ktem package at
ktem/assets/vendor/pdfjs/LICENSE.pdfjs.
